MODEL signed_costs
    VARIABLE x DOMAIN SEQ[1 2]
    VARIABLE y DOMAIN SEQ[1 2]
    CONSTRAINT different
        KIND ALL_DIFFERENT
        SCOPE SEQ[x y]
    END_CONSTRAINT
    OBJECTIVE LINEAR
        TERMS SEQ[SEQ[1 x] SEQ[-2 y]]
        OFFSET 0
    END_OBJECTIVE
    QUERY optimum MINIMIZE
    END_QUERY
END_MODEL
